    - target: {fileID: 4121781233791526338, guid: 2bd50a0daacf44b4084a8222dadf7e47, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "<b>Credits\r\n</b>\r\n\r\nA game by wolfheat\r\n\r\n\r\nA variety of
        assets were used to create this game.\r\n\r\n\r\n<b>Graphics\r\n</b>\r\n\r\n3D\r\nPure
        Poly - Ultimate Low Poly Mining\r\nBitGem - Hand Painted Series\r\nSiuniaev
        - Gambler Cat\r\nInstant Zoomies - Horror Starter Pack Free\r\nSynty - Ancient
        Empire\r\n\r\n2D\r\nVector Dividers Collection\r\nupklyak (freepik) - Ground
        cracks on land isolated\r\n\r\nVFX\r\nUnity Technologies - Particle Pack\r\n\r\n<b>Audio\r\n</b>\r\n\r\nFreesound
        - Various Sounds\r\nPixabay - Various Sounds\r\nUppbeat - Music\r\n\r\nVasyl
        Sakal - Celestial Lullaby \r\nMonument Music - Love Story\r\n\r\n<b>Fonts\r\n</b>\r\n\r\nPrida01
        - gluk\r\n\r\n<b>AI Tools\r\n</b>\r\n\r\nPlayground AI - 2D art\r\nCraiyon
        - 2D art\r\nPiclumen - 2D art\r\nSuno - Boss Music\r\n\r\n<b>Other Tools
        Used\r\n</b>\r\n\r\nAudacity\r\n\r\nGimp\r\n\r\nBlender\r\n\r\nUnity\r\n\r\n<b>Game
        Jam\r\n</b>\r\n\r\nThis game was created for the\r\nDungeon Crawler Game
        Jam 2025\r\n\r\n\r\nThank you for playing!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4981430551951600977, guid: 2bd50a0daacf44b4084a8222dadf7e47, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_AnchorMax.y
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
